{"seq":43,"slug":"frontend-form-engineering","title":"前端表单工程","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.64,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 前端表单工程\n\n表单是用户向系统投递结构化意图的主要通道——注册、下单、转账、申报、配置，几乎所有「写操作」都经由某个表单完成。可正因为它如此常见，工程师容易把它当成「几个 input 加一个提交按钮」的小事，直到第三十个字段、第五条联动规则、第二次后端唯一性校验把代码拖进泥潭。这个 hub 的立场很明确：表单不是 UI 装饰，而是一套需要被认真设计的复杂状态系统，值得用工程的方法去拆解、建模、约束。\n\n整个 hub 沿四条主线层层递进，刻意把「机制」与「体验」与「落地」分开，避免在每一篇里反复纠缠同样的概念。\n\n第一条线是**基础**：先回答「表单为什么难」，把状态爆炸、校验时机、异步、可访问性这几个根因摆上台面；再确立两个地基概念——受控与非受控的取舍、以及一张能贯穿全 hub 的表单状态模型（值、错误、触碰、脏、提交态）。后面所有讨论都站在这张状态图之上。\n\n第二条线是**校验**：把「何时校验、用什么校验、跨网络校验」三件事分开讲。校验策略管时机（onChange/onBlur/onSubmit 与防抖节流），模式校验管声明式约束（Zod 4、Valibot、ArkType 与 Standard Schema 协议），异步校验管与服务端往返时的竞态与去重。三篇各守一摊，彼此引用而不重复。\n\n第三条线是**交互体验**：同样的校验结果，呈现得好不好直接决定用户能否完成任务。错误提示谈文案、位置与时机，可访问性谈 ARIA 与屏幕阅读器的硬机制，复杂输入控件谈组合框、日期、文件、多步等高难度部件。\n\n第四条线是**工程实践**：把前三条线落到真实代码里。表单库一篇横向比较 React Hook Form、TanStack Form、Formik 与 React 19 原生 Actions；大型动态表单一篇处理字段数组、条件字段、性能与向导；陷阱一篇收束全 hub，把最常见的误用集中示警。\n\n读法上，建议先读基础三篇建立词汇与状态模型，再按需切入校验或体验。每篇都用相对链接指向它所依赖的主讲篇，构成一张知识网而非孤岛。把表单当系统来工程化，正是这个 hub 想传递的唯一核心态度。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-forms-hard","title":"为什么表单复杂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/foundations/why-forms-hard"},{"seq":2,"slug":"controlled-uncontrolled","title":"受控与非受控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/foundations/controlled-uncontrolled"},{"seq":3,"slug":"form-state-model","title":"表单状态模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/foundations/form-state-model"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"validation","title":"校验","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/validation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"validation-strategies","title":"校验策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/validation/validation-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"schema-validation","title":"模式校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/validation/schema-validation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"async-validation","title":"异步校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/validation/async-validation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ux","title":"交互体验","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/ux","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"error-messaging","title":"错误提示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/ux/error-messaging"},{"seq":2,"slug":"accessibility-forms","title":"表单可访问性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/ux/accessibility-forms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"complex-inputs","title":"复杂输入控件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/ux/complex-inputs"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"form-libraries","title":"表单库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/practice/form-libraries"},{"seq":2,"slug":"large-dynamic-forms","title":"大型动态表单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/practice/large-dynamic-forms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pitfalls","title":"陷阱与误用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-form-engineering/practice/pitfalls"}]}]}